Revision history for Unblock-WebSocket

0.01  unreleased

    - Begin standalone platform- and event-loop-neutral WebSocket engine.
    - Add portable client and server byte-stream protocol engines.
    - Add framing, masking, fragmentation, UTF-8, Ping/Pong, and Close handling.
    - Add Uniform::HTTP handshake support for HTTP/1.1 Upgrade and HTTP/2 or
      HTTP/3 Extended CONNECT.
    - Define a private versioned native-adapter ABI for zero-copy-capable transports.
    - Add a vendored bq_websocket native engine with portable secure random masking.
    - Add Linux, macOS, and Windows CI for the native core.
